    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "オイ ヤメテオケ ヤツトノ対話ハ 無駄ダ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055348.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ヌウ・・・オレサマ ハラペコ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055374.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "やめておくがよい 意味を持たぬことはな",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0553a0.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "この様な外道を のさばらせてはおけません",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0553cc.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "こんな方と お話し しても 無駄よ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0553f8.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "つまんね−ヤツだから 構うことね−よ！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055424.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "刺してやろうよ こんなの",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055450.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "このおじさん あいてにしちゃ ダメだよ！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o05547c.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "早く 血ぃ出そぉ 出そぉ～{happy_symbol}",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0554a8.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "だめよ！！ あんなヒドイ人 相手にしちゃ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0554d4.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "やめろおおおお やめろ やめろ やめろお",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055500.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "これも定めじゃけェ カンニンしてくれェ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o05552c.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あんな奴 死んでいいよ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055558.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あいつ あかん！ ほっとけ！ ほっとけ！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055584.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "おばえモォ 手手手手手伝エェ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0555b0.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "敵他禁止中仮MES会話種族F会話不能",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0555dc.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "イイ 月夜ダ… ウオオオオオ…！！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055608.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "アオォォォ！ アオアオォォォォ！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055634.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "今拉の 月は 美しい…",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055660.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "何かが起こりそうな 夜ですね",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o05568c.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ああ 美しい月… わたくしドキドキするわ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0556b8.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "こんな明るい夜は どっか遊び 行きて−な",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0556e4.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "月に1度は ゴキゲンナナメよ！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055710.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "よふかしだ よふかしだ ワーイ ワーイ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o05573c.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "おいしそぉ～な月だねぇ うふふふ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055768.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ねえ… アタシ いつもよりキレイでしょ…",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055794.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ウオオオオオオ オオオオォォオォオォ！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0557c0.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "オォオォ 満月かい 風流じゃのゥ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o0557ec.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "月にかわって……なんでもねぇよ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055818.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ええ 月夜や！！ 一杯やりたいなあ～！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055844.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "グゲェ 丸イ月月月 美美美美ジイィ",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.combat_condition_messages.o055870.text",
    "source_encoding": "game_font16_plain_separator_space",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "満月中仮MES会話種族F会話不能",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
